     1696       end.
     1697       assign
     1698         l-query-was-opened = true
     1699       .
     1700     end.
     1701   end.
     1702     run waitfram-hide in this-procedure .
     1703     if p-open-query <> yes then do: reposition br-line to recid doc-rec no-error. end.
